\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Very little information has emerged about the suspect, whose face was covered, but he is believed to be around 18 years old. Police said on Monday he was wearing a white t-shirt and shorts and had dark hair. Security forces also told Spanish newspaper ABC that he fled in an old grey Ford Mondeo.}
