\ulnone\cf2 The lawyers of the Ordo Iuris Institute received a response from the Minister of Foreign Affairs to a request for intervention in the extraordinary Klaman case whereby four Polish children were taken away from their parents and placed in three different foster families in Sweden, where, according to the parents' accounts, they are forbidden to speak Polish.}
