\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 In response to the request for support for the Klaman family, Poland's Minister of Foreign Affairs Radoslaw Sikorski outlined the investigative steps taken by the Ministry in connection with the Ordo Iuris Institute's intervention.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
